# Gran-Gran counts "Lesson cards in your graveyard" and reduces "spells you cast". Bot1 has two Lessons (turn 1); Bot2 puts two
# of its own in its graveyard on turn 2 (four Lessons in all, so counting the opponent's would reduce Bot1's Sol Ring on turn 3):
# Bot1's Sol Ring still costs {1} (pool empty after the cast). Turn 4: Bot2, with three Lessons of its own in its graveyard
# but not Gran-Gran's controller, casts Sol Ring for its full {1}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Gran-Gran
